      "featured_image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0631/0251/7500/files/4_3_sway_01.jpg?v=1754299590",
      "description_html": "<p class=\"generic-text  padding-line-element\">Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, the Sway outdoor coffee table by Yabu Pushelberg exudes warmth and natural charm.</p>\n<section class=\"content-block dimension-medium\" id=\"block-3\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content\">\n<div class=\"block-text block-text__align-left  row animation-y\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"generic-text\">The series of coffee tables, available in three sizes, features the same aesthetic motifs as the Sway family, presenting a harmonious and customizable addition. Perfect for serving refreshments or displaying decorative accents, this small coffee table is designed to enhance the overall ambiance and style.</p>\n<section class=\"content-block\" id=\"block-5\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content  dimension-medium\">\n<div class=\"block-text-img block-text-img_small block-text-img_text-right  row\">\n<div class=\"block-text-img-text  col-4  is-768\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"generic-text\">It is available with a natural teak wood finish, with a sleek ceramic finish or with a fabric inclusion, bringing an elegant texture to the tabletop for both style and functionality.</p>\n<p class=\"block-text-label\"> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>"
