      "description_html": "<p class=\"text-special-sm\">Elevate your outdoor oasis with the Mateo Outdoor Coffee Table.</p>\n<p class=\"text-special-sm\"><span>Featuring a sleek light grey glaze and modern silhouette, this table introduces a refined, minimalist aesthetic. Perfectly balancing form and function, its elegant surface serves as a captivating focal point for alfresco gatherings, inviting luxury and style into your environment. Ideal for discerning tastes seeking understated sophistication.</span><br></p>\n<p class=\"text-special-sm\"><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<strong>Dimensions</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"pb-6\">\n<div class=\"full-dimensions measurement-cm\">\n<ul class=\"dimensions-list\">\n<li class=\"odd:bg-container py-1 px-2\"><span class=\"dimension-value\">L. 98 | W. 98 | H. 42.5 cm</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"dimension-value\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<strong>Specifications</strong></span></p>\n<table class=\"additional-attributes w-full\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"odd:bg-container\">\n<th class=\"col label w-1/2 py-1 text-left text-black product-attribute-label font-bold pl-2\" scope=\"row\">General info</th>\n<td class=\"col data w-1/2 py-1 pl-2 text-left text-gray-900 product-attribute-value\" data-th=\"General info\">Light grey glaze</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd:bg-container\">\n<th class=\"col label w-1/2 py-1 text-left text-black product-attribute-label font-bold pl-2\" scope=\"row\">Max Weight Load KG</th>\n<td class=\"col data w-1/2 py-1 pl-2 text-left text-gray-900 product-attribute-value\" data-th=\"Max Weight Load KG\">193</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd:bg-container\">\n<th class=\"col label w-1/2 py-1 text-left text-black product-attribute-label font-bold pl-2\" scope=\"row\">Max Weight Load LBS</th>\n<td class=\"col data w-1/2 py-1 pl-2 text-left text-gray-900 product-attribute-value\" data-th=\"Max Weight Load LBS\">425.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd:bg-container\">\n<th class=\"col label w-1/2 py-1 text-left text-